From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yuichi Kusakabe <yuichi_kusakabe@jp.honda>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 00:36:57 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] west.yml: Zephyr 4.4.1 and zephyrproject-rtos xenlib


Move the Dom0 west pins to Zephyr 4.4.1 and switch zephyr-xenlib to its
upstream at zephyrproject-rtos. fatfs has to move with Zephyr: v4.4.1's
modules/fatfs/zephyr_fatfs_config.h asserts `FFCONF_DEF == 80386` and the
previous pin is 80286, so the old rev no longer compiles.

moulin's west source can only pin the manifest repository's url/rev, so the
project pins can only be changed by patching this file - which is why this
patch is applied first and `west update` is then re-run (see apply-zephyr-
patches.sh).

Assisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5[1m]
Signed-off-by: Yuichi Kusakabe <yuichi_kusakabe@jp.honda>
Upstream-Status: Pending [xen-troops/zephyr-dom0-xt]
---
diff --git a/west.yml b/west.yml
index fdc0ac8..d60c584 100644
--- a/west.yml
+++ b/west.yml
@@ -12,16 +12,26 @@ manifest:
       url-base: https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/
 
   projects:
+    # Pins are SHAs, not branch/tag names: a branch name makes the build
+    # irreproducible (it changes the moment upstream moves) and unreviewable in
+    # a PR. The symbolic name each SHA came from is in the comment.
     - name: zephyr
       remote: xentroops
-      revision: f12d445f792d562f23c107379267f07674ab5ebd
+      revision: 1f6485eca25431b5ff27ce9a754218c9e559bbbb  # zephyr-v4.4.1-xt = upstream v4.4.1
       west-commands: scripts/west-commands.yml
+    # zephyrproject-rtos is the upstream for xenlib now; xen-troops/zephyr-xenlib
+    # is a mirror at the same SHA. The upstream side carries no tags at all, so
+    # the old `v3.2.0` tag cannot be expressed here - this pin is main.
     - name: zephyr-xenlib
-      remote: xentroops
-      revision: v3.2.0
+      remote: zephyrproject-rtos
+      revision: 7f0884563f865a2a223f26dd0d847fb0faad397d  # main
+    # Must track what this Zephyr expects: modules/fatfs/zephyr_fatfs_config.h
+    # in v4.4.1 has `#if FFCONF_DEF != 80386`, and the previous pin (427159bf)
+    # is FF_DEFINED 80286 -> hard compile error. f4ead3bf is what v4.4.1's own
+    # west.yml points at (FatFs 0.16).
     - name: fatfs
       remote: zephyrproject-rtos
-      revision: 427159bf95ea49b7680facffaa29ad506b42709b
+      revision: f4ead3bf4a6dab3a07d7b5f5315795c073db568d  # v4.4.1 west.yml
     - name: zephyr-xrun
       remote: xentroops
-      revision: 5b6ecf274bac79b0be740693766a88d3eedf3b44
+      revision: 5b6ecf274bac79b0be740693766a88d3eedf3b44  # v0.1.0, unchanged
